<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Romete</book>
  <para style="h">Romete</para>
  <para style="toc1">Romete</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romete</para>
  <para style="mt">Romete</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha hil tu in Pathian ii a sap, sawltak khat tu in a teal, Jesus Christ ii naseampa ahi Paul ii laithak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua Lungdamna Thupha sia Lai Thiangtho sungah a ki at sa bangma taanghlai pek panin a kamsaangte tungtawnin Pathian ii kamciam a piaksa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua in ih Topa Jesus Christ, ama Tapa huvau ahi hi: cii le sa panin ama David suan hi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian pianzia taw ci leang thina panin a lian vaangletna taw a kithawsak kikna in Pathian Tapa a hina kilanghsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama tungtawnin mi namcin sung pan mihing theampo ii a up thei natu le a thu a nit thei natu in Christ hu in Pathian in kei sia sawltak khat sua theina thupha hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesus Christ neisa a suak tu in Pathian hong sapsa Rome khua a om note zongh hi thu in hong huam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in hong it a, ama minam suak tu in, hong sapsa no Rome khua a omte theampo tungah lai kong thaak hi. Ih Pa Pathian le ih Topa Jesus Christ in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A masa phitbel in no tungtaang ah Jesus Christ tungtawnin Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko hi, banghang ziam cile leitung theampo in na upna thu uh hong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Tapa ii Lungdamna Thupha ka hilsak, ka thin theampo taw ka sepsak, tu a ka son teng sia thumaan a hina thu ah — Pathian sia ka tetti ahi hi. No kong phawna sia Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thu ka nget simin hong he hi. Pathian ii deina ahi nale tu in no kungah kong haw tu sia hong suaksak thei takpi le ci in ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note hong thakhosak tu, Thaa thupha hong hawm sawn tu in kong mu nuam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka cinopna pan kei upna hu in note phat tuamna nga in, note upna hu in kei zongh phat tuamna nga tu a, hun khat sungah a kihu tetek ih hina thu ka son nopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Suapuite awng hi thu na teptee tu ka dei a, tamvei ma note kungah hong haw tu in ka ngeal zo hi, ahihang tuabang ka hi thei natu in na khat po in hong khak tawntung hi. Gentile te sung panin a kikheal ka omsak bangma in, no sung pan zong kikhealsak zawk nei leng ka uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile heakna nei te ahizong a nei ngawlte ahizong, pilna neite ahizong a nei ngawlte ahizong mihing theampo ii tungah vaipuak ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Rome khua ah a teang no tung zongh ah Lungdamna Thupha hil tu ka lawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungdamna thupha sungah a kicingin muanna ka nei hi; tua in a umte theampo kingup natu Pathian ii vaangletna hi a Jew mite atu hi photin, tua zawkciang Gentile te atu zongh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile lungdamna thupha in Pathian le mihingte bangbangin kilemzawng thei tu ziam ci in hong pualaak hi: a patna panin a tawp dong upna tungtawnin a piang ahi hi. Laithiangtho sungah “Upna tungtawnin Pathian mai ah thutang a kisuaksak sia in nungta tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thumaan thu a kiheak tu a khaktan mihingte ngitlona le mawnate hu in Pathian thin uukna sia vantung panin hong kilanghsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian in amate daan pia hi, banghang ziam cile mihingte ii Pathian a heak natu sia Pathian mama in amate tungah telthiangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian ii simlei a bitphua pan kipan a kimu thei ngawl Pathian phatna ahi, ama ii tawntung vaangletna le thaa pianziate thiang takin kimu a; tuate sia Pathian ii vawt nate tung panin kitel thei hi. Tua ahikom mihingte in kam zon natu bangma a nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in Pathian he ahihang a upat tu bangin upat ngawl uh a, ama tungah lungdam a ko tu bangin ko ngawl uh hi. Amate khua ngaisutna mannung mama ngawl a, amate thinsung hawmin, khuazing taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate ciim kisa ahihang mawmaw uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a nungta tawntung Pathian a biak tu luangin a thithei mihing, vacim, ngamsa, awmtaal in a vak nganhingte meal taw kibang limte bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom, amate thinsung ah a uuk kiihuai ngamtatnate vawt tu in, Pathian in amate thazau a, tuaciangin amate khat le khat tungah maizumhuai nate kivawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian huvau thumaante sia leilot thu suaksak uh a, Bitphuapa Pathian bia ngawlin a bitphua sa nate bia zaw uh hi. Pathian a tawntungin kipok tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate hi bangin ngamta ahikom, Pathian in amate sia a maizumhuai cii le sa deina sungah thazau hi. A numeite ngawngawn in amate pumpi zak tu bangin zangh ngawlin ngeina ngawl bangin zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuabang ma in pate zongh in numei taw omkhop tu sangin, pa le pa khial nopna thin nei uh hi. Pate in a maizumhuai pa le pa khialnate vawt a, tua hu in amate taw a kiphu daante kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian huvau heakna maante sia mihingte in khua ngaisut in nei nuam ngawl ahikom Pathian in amate ngamtat tuak ngawlte ngamtat theina ngaisutna sungah thazau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in ngitlona, siatna, duhopna le kilalsak theina namcinte taw kidim a; ki eenna, kisuamlupna, kihauna, ngualtheamna le siatvawt nopna thin taw kidim uh hi. Amate nawnsan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />khat le khat kingensia hi; amate in Pathian ensan a, sisuak in, kiphasak a kisuangtaak hi; siatna namcin phuang a; nute pate thu ni ngawl uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pha le a sia khentel theina thinsung nei ngawl, kamciam len ngawlin ngual hesuak theina le thuthiamna nei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi bangin a nungtate sia Pathian thukham in thidaan thuak hen a ci hunlam zongh amate in he uh hi. Ahitazong, a ngamtatna kheal ngawl bek dom ngawlin, tuabang a ngamtate zongh thukimpui lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note in ngual tungah thukhen hi ngawl nu ziam? Akua po na hi uh zong na paulap tu om ngawl hi. Banghang ziam cile ngual tungah thu na khen uh ciangin noma zongh amate ngamtat bangma in na ngamta veve uh le noma le noma thu kikhen na suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in hi bang a ngamtate tungah thu a khen ciangin thutang taw thukhen hi ci in ka he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang no, ngual tung a thukhente awng, noma zongh in amate ngamtat bangma in ngamta na hi uh hi! Pathian thukhenna taw kipeal thei tu ki um na hi uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahibuale ama ii cikna, thiamna le dual zawknate zawnsak vawt na hi uh ziam? A tatakin Pathian cingh mama hi, banghang ziam cile na kisiik kik natu in ama in hanciam in lam hong pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang note na thin uh pui in na lungtang uh sak hi, tua ahikom Pathian sia thin uukna le thutang taw thu a khen Ni ciangin na daan khak tu uh sia a nasia seseam in hong kilangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in mihing sim in a sep a vawt bangin thaman a pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in nasep pha seam zomin minthanna, upatna le thi mawk nuntaknate Pathian kungah zong uh hi. Tuate tungah Pathian in tawntung nuntakna pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midangte ahile amate atu bek ngaisun in, thumaan nial in a maan ngawl thu zui uh hi; tuate tungah Pathian in a thangsiatna le a thin uukna buak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siatna a vawt mihing theampo tungah thuakna le natna hong om tu a, Jew te masa phot tu a tua zawkciangin Gentile te zongin thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in minthanna, upatna le thinnopna sia thupha vawtte theampo tungah, Jew te masa photin Gentile te zongh pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in mihing khat sim tungah a kibang khaiteena taw thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gentile te in Moses Thukhamte a nei bua uh hi; amate in Thukham puasia ah om in, mawna vawtin mangthang uh hi. Jew te in Thukham nei uh hi; amate maw a Thukham in amate thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian mai ah thutang suana in Thukham zaakna taw piang ngawl a Thukham sawlnate zuina taw piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gentile te in Thukham nei ngawl hi; ahihang Thukham sawl bangin ngamta tu in amate le amate in a thinsung uh ah a khensat uh simin Thukham nei suak uh hi. Thukham nei ngawlte hi phot ahihang a neite suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate ngamtatna in Thukham sawlnate a thinsung ah ki at hi ci in lak hi. A thinsung uh ah, kithasun theina le kithutangsak theina a nei theina zongh in, hi thu maan hi ci in lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Lungdamna Thupha ka hilna bangin ci leang, mihing theampo ii a thimtham ngaisutnate tungah Jesus tungtawnin Pathian in thu a khen Ni ciang, tu a ih son bangin hong piang tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No, Jew te ka hi uh a cite awng, note sia Thukham suangin Pathian huvau ah a kisuangtaakte na hi uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in bangbangin ngamta le hong oai ziam ci in na he uh a, Thukham panin a maan le a maan ngawl thute teal thei natu na sin zo uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />note in mittawte lamlak tu, khuazing sung a omte atu khuavak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a mawmawte atu a hilpa, khuatel ngawlte atu syapa na hi uh hi. Thukham sungah thumaan le heakna kicing in om hi ci in a kholette na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngual zongh hil thei na hi uh le noma le noma banghangin kihil ngawl nu ziam? “Nguta heak vun,” ci in na hil uh hi. Ahihang noma mama in na ngu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Palngul mawna na vawt heak vun,” na ci uh hi — Noma in palngul mawna na vawt uh ziam? Milim biakna na ngaimaw uh hi — ahihang, biakinnte zawthawk thu taw na phuul uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian Thukham nei hing ci in kisuangtaak nu hi — ahihang a thukham na paltanna uh taw Pathian min na paansak uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “No Jew te hu in Gentile te in Pathian sonsia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thukham na tang uh le na vunteap atna in man nei hi; ahihang Thukham na tang bua uh le na vunteap at bua le uhte phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gentile mite vunteap a at ngawlte in Thukham thupiakna a ni uh le Pathian in vunteap atte bangma in ngaisun ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom Thukham nei a vunteap at napi in, tua Thukham a zui ngawl no Jew te sia vunteap at ngawl napi thukham a zui Gentile te in hong ningkhiin tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vunteap ki at takpi a, Jew tatak a kicite sia akua bangte hi peuma tu ziam? A puatham bek Jew hi a vunteap atna in cii le sa bek ahite Jew tatak kici ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jew tatak a kicite sia a sungsang Jew hi a, a thinsung vunteap a ki at, tua zongh Pathian Thaa ii sepna taw a ki at hi in, thukham ii sep le vawt ahi ngawlte hi. Hi bang mite in mihingte pokna hi ngawlin Pathian pokna saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile Jew te in Gentile te sangin hamphat zawkna khat po a nei ziam? Tua ahibuale vunteap atna ah bang phat tuamna om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phat tuamna nam tam mama om hi! a masa phitbel in Pathian in a thu a kizaaksak natu in Jew te muang phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang hi thu huvau ah amate sungah thumaan ngawl pawlkhat om le, bang suak tu ziam? Hisia in Pathian thumaan ngawl tu hi cina hi tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang hi ngawl het hi. Mihing sim in leilot kale zong Pathian ahile a thumaan kul veve tu hi. Laithiangtho in hi bangin ci hi. “Na pau ciangin thumaan na hi hunlam kilak tu a, thu hong kisit ciangin a thu na zaw kul hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang eite thutang ngawl ih hina in Pathian sia thutang ahi hunlam kiciansak ahile eite in bang ih son tuan nawn tu ziam? Pathian in daan hong piak ciangin ama sia thutang ngawl hi ih ci thei ziam? (Tu a teng sia mihing ngeina bangin ka pau hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi vet ngawl hi! Pathian thutang ngawl hile bangbangin ama in leitung buppi thukhen thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang keima ii thumaan ngawlna in Pathian thumaanna kiciansak zaw kan a, ama ii minthanna suaksak le bangbang hi tu ziam? Tua ahile banghangin kei mawnei hi ci in hong kipuavawk lalai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahile banghangin “Thupha pianna tu in thusia vawt tawng,” ci ngawl hi ziam? Mihing pawlkhat in tu a ka ci bangin pau hi ci in mawsiatin hong lang hi! Tuabang mihingte in a kiphu bangin puavawkna thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahile ei Jew te in Gentile te sangin phazaw ih hi ziam? Hi tuan ngawl hi! Ka sonsa bangma in Jew te le Gentile te sia a kibangin mawna vaangletna nuai ah om siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “A thumaan thutang kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ciim kuama om ngawl a, Pathian a bia kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihingte a vekpi in Pathian sang panin lampial zo a, amate lamkhial siat zo uh hi. A maan na a seam, kuama om ngawl a, khat bebeak zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kampau te in thi theina kitheamna thu taw kidim a; a leei uh panin leilot thu pusuak hi, a lauhuai tawnnate ngulnguu bangin a muk uh panin pusuak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a kam uh sia longsia khakngal taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in ngual liamsua tu le a thatlum tu in palvang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a paina theampo ah amate in siatna le lalna piangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in kilemna lampi a he bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian thasia natu zongh a sin ngei bua uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung buppi Pathian thukhenna sungah a thet natu le mihingte kam zon theina theampo a bo thei natu in Thukham sungah thu omte theampo in Thukham khutnuai ah a omte atu ahi hunlam ka he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian mai ah Thukham tanna hangin kuama thutang suak zo om ngawl a; Thukham nasepna in mihing khat mawnei ahi hunlam a kiheak natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang tu in Pathian ii mihingte thutang a suasakzia hong kipualaak zo hi. Thukham le kamsaangte lai atte in maan hi ci in tetti pang ahitazong, tuasia in thukham taw kisai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in mihingte sia Jesus Christ a upna uh tungtawnin thutang suaksak hi. Christ a umte theampo tungah Pathian in hi bangin vawt hi, banghang ziam cile kuama a kilamdang tuatuan a om bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihing theampo maw siat zo a Pathian ii ngum tu in hong ompuina pan kikhuala siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang amate a suaktasak Jesus Christ tungtawnin, Pathian ii man piak ngawlin hong piak thuthiamna letsong taw amate thutang kisuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama ii kipumpiak biakpiak natu in hong thina taw amate upna tungtawnin, mihingte mawna kimaisakna a pian natu in, Pathian in ama hong pia hi. Pathian in thutang ahi hunlam hong lak natu in, hi bangin a vawt hi. A bosa hun sungah ama a thin uai a, mihingte mawnate hong tha thong hi; ahihang tu in ama sia, thutang ahi hunlam a kilak natu in, mihingte mawna tungtaang ah na hong seam hi. Hi bangin Pathian in ama sia thutang ahi hunlam le Jesus Christ a um peuma thutang a suasakna thu hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahiciang eite kisuantaak natu bang om ziam? Bangma om ngawl hi! Tua hile thutang suana in koisung pan hong piang ziam? Thukham nitna sepna pan ziam? Hi ngawl hi, upna pan bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing khat sia Pathian mai ah upna tungtawn bek in thutang suak thei bek a, Thukham sawl bang a sepna pan hi ngawl hi ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahibuale Pathian sia Jew te ii Pathian hi bek ziam? Gentile te Pathian zongh hi ngawl ziam? Hi leilam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian sia khat hi a, Jew te zongh a upna uh tungtawnin, thutang suaksak a, Gentile te zongh a upna tungtawnin, thutang kisuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Upna in Thukham phiat hi cinopna ahi ziam? Hi ngawl het hi; eite in Thukham ih kipsak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile ih pianna pa ahi Abraham thuakna sa tungtaang ah bang ih son tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii ngamtatna tung panin Pathian in thutang suaksak ahile a kisuantaak natu nei tu hi — ahihang Pathian mai ah ama in bangma kisuantaak natu om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Abraham in Pathian um a, tua a upna hu in Pathian in thutang suaksak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naseam khat in sep thaman saang hi, tua thaman sia letsong kici thei ngawl hi; a thalaw sa hi ci in kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang sepna hi ngawl a upna a nei sia in, mimawte maw ngawl hi a ci Pathian a up hu in, a upna sia Pathian in saang a, thutang suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thu in sepna kihel ngawl Pathian ii thutang hi ci in a saan, mihingte ii lungdamna, David ii son sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tatkhialnate kimaisak a, a mawna pan a kisuatak te bangza in a lungdam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ii a mawnate sazian in a teptee ngawl tu sia in mihing lungdam ahi hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi lungdamna David ii son sia vunteap atte bek atu ahi ziam? Hi ngawl hi! Vunteap at ngawlte atu zongh ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho sungah a ki at bangin ih sonsa hi a, “Abraham in Pathian um a, tua a upna hangin Pathian in ama thutang hi, ci in saang hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi thu bang hun laitakin piang ziam? Abraham vunteap a at zawkciang ziam? A at ma ziam? A at ma hi a, a at zawk hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama sia a khak sang ciangin a vunteap at pheang hi. Vunteap a atna zongh, Abraham in Pathian um ahikom Pathian in ama a vunteap a at ma in thutang hi ci a tepteena lim ahi hi. Tua ahikom Abraham in Pathian um a, thutang hi ci in ama ii a saante theampo, a vunteap at vateal ta buale kuama theampo ii thaa lamsang ah a pa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in vunteap atte ii pa zongh hi a, vunteap a at bek dom ngawlin, ih pa Abraham vunteap a at ma a, upna taw a nuntakna sungah ama bangma in a nungta te ii pa zongh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in Abraham le a suan a paalte munah hi leitung sia amate atu hi ci in kamciam pia hi, hi kamciam in Abraham ii thukham a nit hu hi ngawl a, a up hangin thutang hi ci a, Pathian in a teptee hu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ii kamciam sia Thukham a tangte atu hi thong le mihingte upna sia a lui thawthong suak tu a, Pathian kamciam zongh man nei ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thukham in Pathian thin uukna piangsak hi; Ahihang thukham om ngawlna munah thukham paltanna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian kamciam in upna bulphu in nei a, tua ahikom Abraham suan le paal Thukham tangte bek hi ngawlin — Abraham up bangin a umte theampo tungah man nei ngawlin a piak tu in kho takin vawt hi. Banghang ziam cile Abraham in eite theampo ii thaa lam sangah ih pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Minam tam mama ii pa kong suaksak zo hi,” a ci bangma ahi hi. Tua ahikom a thisa a nungtasak kik thei, a om ngeingawl laite thupiakna taw a piangsak thei, Abraham ii a up Pathian ii a muna ah tua kamciam sia kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Muanmawk lamet natu om ngawl kawm panin Abraham in um a muangmaw ahikom ama sia “minam tam mamate pa” suak hi. Laithiangtho in “Na suan na paal te aksi za in tam tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hun lai in ama kum zakhat pha dektak zo a, a pumpi sia a thithi ma hi zo in, tua bek dom ngawlin Sarah in ta nei thei ngawl ahitazong a upna a thaneam tuan bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a upna thasua ngawl a, Pathian kamciam zongh a muang la bua hi. A upna in ama thahatna taw kidimsak a, ama in Pathian pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ii a thinsung tawngh pan a upna sia, Pathian in kamciam a piak bangin tungsak tu hi ci in um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua thu hangin Abraham in upna tungtawnin, “Pathian in thutang hi ci in saang hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ama sia thutang hi ci in kisaang hi,” ci kammal zongh ama bek atu a kici ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus thina pan a tho kiksak ama a um, thutang hi ci in hong kiciamtee ei atu zonghin a ki at kammal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesus sia eite ii mawna hu in a thi tu in ki aap a, Pathian mai ah thutang ih sua natu in nuntakna sungah ama kinungta kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in eite upna tungtawnin Pathian in thutang hong suaksak a, ih Topa Jesus Christ tungtawnin, Pathian taw kilemna ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu laitak a ih dinmun ahi Pathian ii thuthiamna sung a theng tu in upna tungtawnin ama in tua munah hong then hi. Tua ahikom eite in Pathian minthanna ih siim natu lametna ih nei hu in ih kisuangtaak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih ngimnate hu zonghin ih angtang hi, banghang ziam cile ngimna in thuak zawkna piangsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thuak zawkna in Pathian thukimna piangsak in, ama hong thukimpuina in lametna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi lametna in hong thinkiamsak bua hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian hong piakthong letsong ahi Thaa Thiangtho zangh in ih thin sungah ama ii itna hong buak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile cimaw a ih om laitakin Pathian ii a teal hun ciangin Christ sia mi ngilote atu in hong thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing thutang khat atu thina thuak tu sia thu haksa ahi hi. Mihing pha khat atu a thi ngam khat po zongh om tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang eite mimaw ih hi laitak ma in eite atu Christ hong thina taw Pathian in eite bangzata in hong it ziam ci hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, tu in ama chisan taw eite Pathian mai ah thutang ih suak hi; tua ahile Pathian thin uukna pan ama in bangza in eite hong ngum zaw kan lai tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite in Pathian ngalte ih hi laitakin, a Tapa thina tungtawnin eite sia ama taw a kilem a lawmte hong suaksak hi. Tu in Pathian lawmte hi zo ih hi le Christ nuntakna in bangza in hong ngum zaw kan lai tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang tua teng bek hi ngawl hi; Pathian lawmte hong suaksak Topa Jesus Christ tungtawn a Pathian sepna tungah ih lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khat tungtawnin mawna leitung ah hong theng a, tuaciang ama mawna in thina hong puak hi. Tua taw kizui in mihing suan theampo tungah thina hong kizel hi. Banghang ziam cile mihing theampo maw zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thukham a kipiak ma in leitung ah mawna om zo hi; ahihang thukham om ngawlna ah mawna sazian kikoi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Adam hun pan kipan Moses hun dongin thina in mihingte uk a, Adam bang a Pathian thupiakna a ni ngawlte bek hi ngawlin a dangte zongh thi uh hi. Adam sia hong pai pheang tu mihing khat ii lim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang tuate ngeal kibang ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii a thong a hong piak letsong in Adam ii mawna taw kibang ngawl hi. Tua mihing khat ii hu in mihing tam mama thi hi. Ahihang Pathian ii thuthiamna lian zaw pek a, tuasia bangma in mihing khat ahi Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna tungtawnin a thong a hong piak letsong sia lian zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabangin Pathian piak letsong le mihing khat ii mawna kilaklaw ah kilamdanna om hi. Mawna khat hang “maw hi” ci a thukhenna piang a, ahihang mawna tam mama kale zong “maw ngawl hi” cina letsong sia kilawm ngawlin hong piang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing khat ii mawna tungtawnin thina in hong uk hi. Ahihang Jesus Christ a kici mihing khat ii sepna taw kizui in bangza in a lianzaw thu piang ziam! Pathian ii a kicing thuthiamna le man nei ngawl a hong piak thutang suana a saangte in Christ tungtawnin a ngualzo nuntakna nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom mawna khat in mihing theampo hong puavawk a, thukhenna a piansak bangma in thutang nasepna khat in mihing theampo suaktasak a, nuntakna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing khat ii thunit ngawl hu in mihing theampo mawnei a kisuasak bangma in, mihing khat thunit hu in mihing theampo Pathian mai ah thutangte kisuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawna ngamtatna a khanto vaial natu in thukham kipia hi, ahihang mawna a khantona munah, Pathian ii thuthiamna khangto seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom mawna in thina taw hong uk bangma in, Pathian ii thuthiamna in thutang suana taw hong uk a, ih Topa Jesus Christ tungtawnin tawntung nuntakna sungah hong then hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ih son tu ziam? Pathian ii thuthiamna a khanto vaial natu in mawna sungah ih nungta tan lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi ngawl het hi. Eite in mawna thi san zo ih hi ciang bangbangin mawna sungah nungtata lai tu hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hi thu na heak uh ahi hi. Eite Christ taw kikopkhawm tu in ih ki baptize ciang ama thina sung zongh ah a kikopkhawm tu in a ki baptize ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ih ki baptize na taw eite ama taw kivuikhawm a, ama thina ih siim hi. Banghang ziam cile Pa ii minthan thahatna taw Christ sia thina panin a kithawsak kik ciang eite zongh nuntakna thak sungah a nungtate ih sua natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama ii a thi bangma in ih thi ciangin ama taw pumkhat suak ih hile, ama a kinuntaksak kik bangma in, eite hong kinuntaksak kikna taw ama taw pumkhat ih suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciangin hi thu ih he hi, ih nuntakna a lui sia thinglamtee tungah Christ taw ih thisak zo a, mawna silate ih hi nawn ngawl natu, mawna vaangletna a kilalcipsak natu in ih nuntakna lui sia Christ taw ama thinglamtee tungah kithisak zo ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing khat a thi ciangin mawna tha hatna panin a kisuaktasak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Christ taw thi khawm zo ih hi nungsang, ama taw ih nungta khawm tu hi, ci zonghin ih um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ sia thina panin kitho kiksak zo a, bangma hunin a thi kik ngei nawn buatu hi — thina in ama uk ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama thi ahi hu in, mawna in ama tungah vaang nei nawn ngawl hi; tu in ama nuntakna in Pathian taw kipawlkhawm in nungta ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in no zongh mawna taw kipee thute ah a thisa in, na kituat vun a, ahizong, Christ Jesus tungtawnin Pathian taw kipawlkhopna sungah a nungta in na kituat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na cii le sa deina na zui ngawl natu in, a thithei na pumpi sia mawna in hong uk nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin, a pha ngawl tupnate sungah a kizangh tu in na pumpi nate khat pawpo aap thei ngawl tu nu hi. Tua hi ngawl zaw in thina pan a kinungtasak kik mihingte bangin na pumpi uh thumaan thutang taw a kizak natu in, Pathian tungah kipia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mawna in hong uk nawn ngawl tu hi; banghang ziam cile note in thukham nuai ah nungta nawn ngawl a, Pathian ii thuthiamna nuai ah a nungta na hi zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ci tu hi ziam? Thukham khutnuai ah om nawn ngawl a Pathian ii thuthiamna khutnuai ah om zo ih hile mawna ih vawt lai tu ziam? Hi ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo ii thu ni tu in noma le noma na ki aap uh ciangin a sila na suak uh sia maan takin na he uh hi — mawna sila na hi uh le thina taw kizom a, tua ahi bua a, thunitna sila na hi uh le Pathian mai ah thutang suana taw kizom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangpo ahizong Pathian tungah lungdamko tawng! Banghang ziam cile khatvei lai in note in mawna silate na hi uh a, na saansa uh hong kihil thumaan thutakte na thin theampo uh taw na ni zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note mawna panin hong kisuaktasak zo a, thutang ii silate na hi zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(A zawngkhal mihing na hi uh hu in na tel thei tu in, ni sim ih zak kammal ol te kong zangh hi.) Khatvei lai in siatna le thiangtho ngawlna sungah a sia tu le a nin tu in noma le noma silate bangin na kipum aap uh bangma in, tu in thutang ii silate bangin tupna thiangtho sungah na kipia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawna silate na hi uh laitakin thumaan thutang taw na kipeal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maizum huai na saknate na vawt uh ciangin, bang meetna na nga uh ziam? Tuate taw a kizom thu in thina ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tu in note sia mawna panin hong kisuaktasak zo a, Pathian silate na hi uh hi. Na meetna uh sia nuntakna a cialcingin ama tungah na kipum aapna uh hi a, tua taw kizom thu in tawntung nuntakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mawna thaman in thina hi a; ahihang tawntung nuntakna sia, ih Topa Jesus Christ taw ih kikopna hangin a thong a hong piak letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suapuite awng, thukham huvau tel siat na hi uh ciang, son tu a kong kipat thu zongh tel mama tu nu hi. Mihing khat a nuntak laiteng bekma in thukham in uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sonteena in numei pasal nei khat sia, a pasal nuntak lai teng bekma in thukham in khii hi; ahihang a pasal a thi le a zi sia tua pasal taw a kikhii khawm tua thukham panin suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom a pasal nungta nginge lai in, numei in pa dang khat taw a teang le a pasal palngul hi kici tu hi; ahihang a pasal a thi le, thukham panin a suakta numei hi a, ngualdang khat a teenpui hangin ama in palngul mawna vawt ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, note zongh tua taw kibang nu hi. Thukham tungtaang ah note zongh thi zo nu hi, banghang ziam cile note in Christ ii pumpi khen khat veu na hi tek uh hi; tuaciang tu in Pathian tungah a taktai sepnate ih nei thei natu in thina pan a, a kitho kiksak Pa ii neisate na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing pianzia bangin ih nuntak laitakin Thukham ii holna taw maw nopnate in ih pumpi sungah na hong seam a, tuaciang thi theina nasepna sungah eite ih kiva mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangpo ahizong, tu in eite Thukham taw ih kipeal zo hi, banghang ziam cile khatvei lai a hong luangtasak tua Thukham ih thi san zo hi. A ki at thukham ngeina lui bangin na ih seam nawn bua a, Thaa ii ngeina thak bangin ih seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ih ci tu ziam? Thukham mama pha ngawl hi ih ci tu ziam? Hi ngawl het hi! Thukham in mawna a ci sia hong hesak hi zaw hi. Thukham in, “Ngual khat ii neisa na dungawk heak vun,” ci buale dungawk ci sia bang ziam ci in ka he buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupiakna ii sawl hu in mawna in ka sungah dungawk nopna tuatuam hong piansak natu hunpha nga hi. Thukham om ngawlna munah mawna sia a thi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima ma zongh khatvei lai in thukham ngawl taw ka nungta ngei hi; ahihang thupiakna a om hunlam ka heak tak ciangin, maw nopna hong thahat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang kei ka thi hi. Tuasia ciangin nuntakna a piangsak tu thupiak sia kei atu thina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mawna in hunpha nga in thupiakna tungtawnin na hong seam a, kei hong theam in hong thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom Thukham in thiangtho a, thupiakna zongh thiangtho in pha a, tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahile hi bangin a pha thu khat in, kei thina hong piangsak hi ci tu hi ziam? Hi ngawl hi! Hong thisak sia in mawna hi, mawna in a pianzia tatak sia a kilangh natu in a pha khat hong zangh a, kei tungah thina hong piangsak ahi hi. Tua ahikom thupiakna a om hu in mawna ii a lauhuai a phat ngawlna kician seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukham sia thaa taw kisai hi ci in ih he hi; ahihang keima in a thithei mihing hi a, mawna sungah sila bangin a kizuak sa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka sep ka vawt sia bang ziam ci in ka tel bua hi; banghang ziam cile ka vawt nopte ka vawt bua a, ka vawt nop ngawl teng ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka vawt nop ngawlte ka vawt ciangin, Thukham sia maan hi ci in ka thukimpuina hong kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom hite a vawt sia in kei tatak ka hi bua hi; ka sung a teang mawna sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing ka hina sungah — a pha bangma om ngawl hi ci in ka he hi. Banghang ziam cile a pha vawt nopna ka sungah a om bel hangin ka vawt thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pha ka vawt nopte ka vawt bua a, ka vawt nop ngawl a siate ka vawt zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka vawt nop ngawlte ka vawt le tuabangin a vawt sia kei ka hi bua hi. Ka sung a teang mawna in vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngeina khat om hi ci in ka phawk hi. A pha khat ka vawt nop ciangin, a sia vawt tu bek teal theina ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka sungah a nungta sia in Pathian thukham diksa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang ka pumpi sungah ngeina dangkhat in na hong seam hi — ka thinsung ii dik a sak ngeina sia a langpan ngeina khat sia ahi hi. Ka pumpi sung a na hong seam mawna taw kisai thukham ii thongtaakpa hong suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangza in a thinngim mihing khi ziam! Thina sung hong zotpui hi pumpi panin akua in hong suatak tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus tungtawnin hong suaktasak Pathian tungah lungdamko tawng! Tua ahikom ka dinmun sia hi bang hi: keima hantang in ci leang Pathian thukham sia ka thinsung bek in zui zo a, ka mihing pianzia ahile mawna ngeinate zui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in Christ taw pumkhat in a nungtate atu in kipuavawkna a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Jesus Christ taw kop a nuntakna sungah hong then thaa ngeina in mawna le thina ngeinate panin hong suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing thaneamna hu a Thukham ii vawt zawk ngawlte Pathian in vawt zo hi. Ama in mihing pianzia sungah mawna a bo cimitsak natu in mihingte mawna pianzia teng ma hong keng a, ama Tapa sia mawna kitat natu in hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ii hi bangin a sepna in ei, mihing pianzia bangin nungta ngawl a, Thaa ngeina bangin a nungtate in Thukham ii thutang sua natu a deina sia a khuangkhim natu in seam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing pianzia bangin a nungtate thinsung sia cii le sa deina in uk hi. Thaa ii sawl bangin a nungtate thinsung sia Thaa ii deina in uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing pianzia in na uksak uh le thina piang a; Thaa in na uksak uh le, nuntakna le thinnopna piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang mihing khat sia mihing pianzia in a uk le Pathian ngal suak hi; banghang ziam cile ama in Pathian thukham ni ngawl hi, a tatakin ni thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing pianzia a zuite in Pathian a lungdamsak thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang note in mihing pianzia ii hong sawl bangin na nungta bua uh hi; Pathian Thaa note sungah hong nungta takpi ma ahi nale — Thaa ii sawl bangin na nungta uh hi. A kuama po Christ ii Thaa a nei ngawl sia in, Christ ii neisa ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Christ note sungah hong teang le Thaa sia no atu in nuntakna ahi hi, banghang ziam cile na pumpi uh mawna hangin thi tu ahitazong note Pathian taw hong kilemzawngsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus thina pan a thosak kik Pathian Thaa note sungah hong teang le thina pan Christ a tho kiksak pa in, a Thaa note sungah a om hu in a thithei na pumpi uh nuntakna hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka suapuite awng, mihing pianzia ii deina bangin ih nuntak ngawl natu in zui tu vaipuak ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing pianzia bangin na nungta uh le na thi takpi tu uh hi; ahihang mawna ngamtatnate Thaa taw na thatlum uh le na nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian Thaa ii lampuina a nga mihing peuma Pathian ii tate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian hong piak Thaa in nang sia sila hong suaksak ngawl a, hong kiitasak ngawl hi; tua hizaw ngawlin, Thaa in Pathian ii tate hong suaksak a, Thaa vaangletna taw eite in Pathian tungah “Pa awng, ka Pa awng!” ih ci thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian Thaa in eima thaa taw kikopin, Pathian ii tate ih hina tetti in hong pang khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tate ih hi zawk nungsang a mite atu a khealsia thuphate ih lua tu a, Christ atu a Pathian ii a koi nate zongh ih lua tu hi; banghang ziam cile Christ ii thuakna ih thuakpui le a minthanna zongh ih lua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu hun a ih thuakte in hong kilangh pheang tu, a minthanna taw kiteengat thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kibitphua sa theampo in Pathian ii tate sia akua bang teng hi tu ziam ci in hong kilaak tu kaal ngakla in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile bitphua sate sia amate ii tupna le sawmnate a taan natu in, amate ii uuk thu hi ngawlin Pathian ii deina taw puavawkna a thuak uh hi. Ahitazong lametna om lai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />bitphua sate in ni khat ni ciangin a muatcip theina sungah sila a tanna sung panin kisuaktasak tu a Pathian ii tate in suatak minthanna nga khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile nausuak tun a nat bangin tu hun dong ma bitphuasa theampo in na a sakna taw tau in om hi ci ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang bitphua sate bek hi ngawlin Pathian ii a leap a letsong hong piak ahi ei Thaa a neite zongh in, Pathian ii tate hong suaksak a, ih nuntakna buppi hong suataksak tu ngakin ih sung sangah ih tau tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite sia lametna hangin hong hun a; ahizong ih lametna sia ih mukhol thei le tuasia in lametna kici thei ngawl tu hi. A mu, nate a muangmaw lai akua om ngei nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang ih mu ngawl lai khat muangmaw ih hile, thinsauna taw ih ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua bangma in eite in bangza in tha zawngkhal hi ka leang, eite hong hu tu in Thaa hong pai hi. Banghang ziam cile eite in thu ih ngetzia tu ih he bua hi; kammal taw a kilo thei ngawlte tauna taw Pathian tungah Thaa in hong maangkaasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciangin mihingte thinsung a mu thei Pathian in Thaa ii khua ngaisutnate he hi; banghang ziam cile Thaa in Pathian tungah a mite atu in ama dei babangin maangkaasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian ii tupna taw a sam sa ahi ama a itte atu in na theampo Pathian in a phabel in piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian teal sate a Tapa taw a kiban natu in, doituam a, tua hu in a Tapa in unau tam mama sung panin ta upabel suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in a tuamin a koi sate sam a, a samte thutang suaksak hi, tua thutang a suasakte ama ii minthanna hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi teng zawkciangin ih son tu, bang om lai tu ziam? Pathian ei sangah hong pang le akua in eite hong langpan thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian in hong langpan ngawl het tu hi. Ama in a Tapa takpi khoaikhe ngawlin, ei atu in hong pia hi! A Tapa ngawngawn hong pia ahile — na theampo a thongin hong pia ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian tealsa mihingte tungah akua in, mawna zong thei tu ziam? Pathian mama in amate mawnei ngawl a suasakte ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahile amate akua in maw pusak thei tu ziam? Thina thuak a, a kinungtasak kik pa, Pathianziatsang ah to a, Pathian tungah ei atu in hong ngetsakpa Christ Jesus in hong mawsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahile Christ ii eite hong itna panin, akua in hong khen thei tu ziam? Ngimna, haksatna, vawtsiatna, ngilkialna, zawnna, lau huaina, thinate khat pawpo in, hong khen thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Laithiangtho in hi bangin a ci bangma “Nang hu in kote thina ii lauhuaina sungah a ni bup in ka om uh hi; kote sia a kingolum tu tuute bangin hong kivawt hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hong itpa tungtawnin eite in hi thute theampo sungah zawna kicing ih nga hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama hong itna panin, bangma in hong khen thei ngawl tu hi ci in maan takin ka mu hi: thina ahizong nuntakna ahizong, vantunglalangte ahizong, vantung ukna le thahatna nei dangte ahizong, tu hun hikale mailam hikale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />leitung a saangbelna mun ahizong, leinuai a thuk belna mun ahizong, bitphua sa a minpiang bangma in ih Topa Jesus Christ sungah ih neisa ahi Pathian hong itna taw hong khen zo a om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thumaan ka son hi; Christ neisa ka hi a, ka leilot bua hi. Thaa Thiangtho ii a uk ka thinsung zongh in leilot ngawl ka hina hong telthiangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka chi ka sa ahi ka mite atu in bangza in khuangai khi ziam! A kizom tan in bangza in lainat law khi ziam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a phattuamna om tu hi thong le amate atu in Pathian haamsiatna thuak leng a, Christ taw zong kikhen law leng zong ka uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Pathian ii mihingte hi uh a; ama in amate sia a tapate suaksak in, a minthanna kilanghsak hi; amate taw kamciamna vawtin Thukham pia hi; amate in a maan biakpiakna nei uh hi; amate in Pathian kamciam saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in khanglui Hebrew minthangte ii suan le paal te hi uh a, Christ ii mihing a hina taw amate ii minampui ahi hi. Na theampo a uk Pathian sia a tawntungin kipok tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian kamciam taangtung ngawl hi ci ngawl khi hi; banghang ziam cile Israel mi theampo Pathian tealsa hi siat ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham ii suan theampo zongh Pathian ii tate hi siat ngawl hi. Pathian in Abraham tungah “Nang kong kamciamna panin na suan le na paalte Isaac tungtawnin na nei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hisia a khiakna in mihing pian ngei bangin a piang thawthongte sia Pathian ii tate hi ngawl a, Pathian kamciam panin a piangte bek a suan le a paal tatakin kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian kamciam sia, hi kammalte bangin kipia hi. “A hun ciangin kong pai kik tu a, Sarah in tapa khat hing tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hisia bek hi ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Rebecca in ih pu Isaac ahi a pasal taw tapa nii nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang tapa khat tealtuam tu sia Pathian ii deina vingveng ahi natu thu huvau in, Pathian in a nu munah, “A u zaw in a nau zaw ii na sepsak tu hi,” ci hi. Ama in hi thu a pau laitakin amate ngeal sia piang ngawl lai a, a sia a pha bangma vawt a nei bualai hi. Tua ahikom Pathian tealna in ama sapna tung pan hi a, amate sepna tung pan hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Jacob ka it a, Esau ka ensan hi,” ci in a ki at bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ih ci tu ziam? Pathian in a kilawm tu bang a thukhen ngawl hi ih ci tu ziam? Kici thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Moses tungah, “Ka hesuak nopte ka hesuak tu a; ka mulkim nopte ka mulkim tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom mihing deina le sepna thu hi ngawlin, Pathian ii hesuakna tungah thu om zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Laithiangtho in Egypt kumpipa tungah a cina pan, “Hi tupna hang le ka vaangletna lak in, leitung theampo ah ka min a kiheak natu in, kumpi kong suaksak a nang kong zangh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in a hesuak nopte tungah hesuak a, thin sahna a piak nopte tungah thin sahna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note sung pan khat po in hong ci tu nu hi. “Hi bang ahile Pathian in mihing khat po tungah mawsakna pia thei tu ziam? Pathian ii deina akua in nial thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang lawmpa awng, Pathian kam a zo kik tu in nang akua na hi ziam? Tungbeal khat in a vawtpa munah, “Banghangin kei hi bangin hong vawt ni ziam?” ci in a dongh thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tatak ci leang bealte a vawtpa in tungmante a dei babangin a zak thei natu thunei a, tungman lom khat panin beal nii vawtin, khat sia hun thupi sung a zak tu, a khat sia hun thawthong sung a zak tu in vawt theina thunei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian nasepna zongh tuasia bangma ahi hi. Ama in a thin uukna lak nuam a, a vaangletna kihesak nuam hi. Ama a thin a uuksak, lalcipna sung a theng tu mihingte thinsauna tatak taw thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kicing ama ii vaangletna zongh hong pualaak nuam a, a minthanna a nga tu in hong vawt sa eite a hesuakna a saang tu mihingte tungah tua a vaangletna hong buak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite sia Jew te sung pan bek hi ngawlin, Gentile te sung pan zong hong sap a minamte ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi thu in Hosea laibu sungah a son teng ahi hi, “Ka mihing ahi ngawlte ‘keima ii mihing’ ka ci tu hi. Ka it ngawl minamte sia ‘ka itte’ awng ka ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuaciangin, note sia ka mihing hi ngawl nu hi,” a kicina mun mama ah amate sia a nungta Pathian ii tate kici tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciangin Israel mite huvau Isaiah in hi bangin ci hi: “Israel mite tuipi hui ah senvui za in a tam hial zong, amate sung panin tawm bek kingum tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa in leitung bup ah hai ngawlin a vai theampo thiangsak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isaiah in a masa in hi bangin ci hi. “Vaanglianbelpa Topa in suan le paal tawm hong kheetsak ngawl hi kapo le, eite Sodom bang ih hi tu a, Gomorrah bang ih suak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian mai ah thutang sua natu a hanciam ngeingawl Gentile te sia a upna tungtawnin thutang suak uh hi, ih ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua laitakin Pathian ii mihingte in Pathian mai ah thutang suana tu in thukham khat zong uh a, a mu bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Banghangin mu ngawl ziam? Banghang ziam cile amate in upna bulphu ngawl a, sepna bulphu uh hi. Amate in laithiangtho sungah a kison “Lutuna Suang” tungah lutu uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“En vun, Zion ah suang khat ka koi a, tua in mihingte lutusak hi, amate a puksak tu suangpi ahi hi. Ahihang ama a umte a thin a kiam buatu hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suapuite awng, ka minamte ngupna a nga natu in ka thinsung theampo taw deisak in Pathian tungah thu ka ngetsak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate sia Pathian thu sungah a kipia mama ahi hunlam tetti ka pang hi; ahihang amate kipiakna in heakna tatak bulphu ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian mai ah mihingte thutang a suasakzia he ngawl a, lampi tuam dang khat sial tu hanciam uh hi. Tua ahikom amate in Pathian ii mihingte thutang a suasakna sungah a ki aap bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a umte theampo Pathian mai ah thutang a sua natu in Christ in thukham bosak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian tungah a thutang na sua natu in, Thukham nitna taw kisai in, Moses ii lai at in hi bang ahi hi: “Thukham sawl bangin a ngamta theampo in tua taw nungta tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang upna hang a Pathian mai ah thutang suana taw kisai in laithiangtho in hi bangin ci hi. “Noma le noma vantung ah akua kaato tu ziam?” ci in kidongh heak vun. (Tuasia Christ khiaksukna, a cinopna hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Akua leinuai ah tuaksuk tu ziam?” ci in kidongh heak vun. (Tuasia in Christ thina pan a thawsak kikna, a cinopna hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi bangin ci zaw hi: “Pathian hong piak kammal sia na kung nai ah om a, na muk tung le na thinsung ah om hi.” — Tua in upna thu ka hil uh sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Jesus in Topa hi ci in na kam taw pualaak a, na thinsung panin, Pathian in ama sia thina pan thosak kik hi ci in na um le ngupna na nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ih thinsung pan ih up ciangin thutang ih suak a, ih kam taw ih pualaak ciangin hong kingum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “A kuama theampo ama a umte in a thin a kiam buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi thu in a kuama po huam siat hi. Banghang ziam cile Jew te le Gentile te kilaklaw ah lamdanna a om bua hi. Pathian in mihing theampo ii Topa hi a, ama tungah a ngen theampo atu in a kicing takin thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laithiangtho ci bangma in Topa tungah huna a ngen theampo kingum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang ama a um bua uh le amate in bangbangin huna ngen thei tu ziam? A thupha puak a za bua uh le, amate in bangbangin um thei tu ziam? A thupha a kithangsak buale amate in bangbangin za thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuhil tute a kipaisak buale a thupha bangbangin kithangsak thei tu ziam? Laithiangtho ci bangma in, “Lungdamna thupha puak a hong paite peang sia bangza in etlawm ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang amate theampo in Lungdamna Thupha saang thei ngawl uh hi. Isaiah mama in, “Topa awng, ko thupuakte akua in hong um ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom upna in a thu zaakna pan piang a, a thu zaakna in, Christ ii thuhilna pan piang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahile amate in a thu za ngawl hi tu ziam?, ci in kong dongh hi. Za hi — laithiangtho in hi bangin ci hi: “Leitung theampo ah amate ii aw theng hi; Amate ii kammal leimong dong theng hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile: Israel mite in he ngawl ziam? ci in kong dongh kik hi. Moses ama mama in hong zo phit hi: “Minam in a kisim ngeingawl mihingte in, eenna thin hong neisak tu hi. A mawmaw minam khat zanghin na thin uh kong uuksak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaiah in hangsan seseam in hi bangin ci hi. “Hong zong ngawlte in kei hong mu hi; Hong kan ngawlte tungah ka kilak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang Israel taw kisai in ama in, “Thu ni ngawlte le hong langpante tungah nitangtum in muakin ka khut ka thaak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile Pathian in ama ii minamte nial hi ci tu hi ziam? Nial ngawl hi! Keima mama zongh Israel te ka hi a, Abraham suan, Benjamin nam sung a kihel khat ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kipat pan a tealsa ahi a minamte Pathian in nial ngawl hi, Pathian tungah Israel te sia Elijah in mawsak a, tua Laithiangtho kammalte na heak uh ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Topa awng, amate in na kamsaangte thatlumin, na biaknataute susia hi; keima bekma taanglai khi hi. Tuaciang keima ngawngawn thalup hong sawm lai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in bangbangin zo kik ziam? “Keima atu in Baal pathian a bia ngawl mihing tulsali koi lai khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu laitakin zongh tuabang ma ahi hi. Thuthiamna taw Pathian tealsa mihing tawm om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tealna in ama thuthiam hu hi a, amate sepna hang hi ngawl hi. Banghang ziam cile Pathian tealna sia mihing sepna tung pan hi thong le thuthiamna ih ci sia in thuthiamna maan hi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ih ci tu ziam? Israel mite in a zon uh sia mu ngawl hi. Pathian tealtuam mi pawlkhat in mu bek hi. A dangte ahile Pathian samna nangonthaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Pathian in a thinsung uh le, a khua ngaisutna bulthusak hi; tuni dong mama in, amate in a mit uh taw mu thei ngawlin a bil uh taw a za thei bua uh hi,” laithiangtho in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang David in, “Amate in a poaipi khaamna sungah thaang kisia tahen a, kiman tahen; amate puk hen a, daan kipia tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khua a mu thei ngawl natu in a mit uh kitawcipsak tahen a, ngimna nencipna taw a tawntungin bawngcip tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile Jew te a lutu uh ciangin a lalcip tu in a liik ziam? ci in kong dongh hi. Hi ngawl hi! Amate maw ahikom ngupna sia Gentile te tungah theng a Jew te ii een tu in kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jew te ii mawna hu in leitung bup in thupha nasia takin saang hi. Tuaciang amate ii thaa zawngkhalna hu in Gentile te thupha nasia takin kipia hi. Tua ahile Jew te sia a pawlcing in a kihuam siat ciangin thupha saanna bangza in lianzaw seseam tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in no Gentile te tungah hong son ka hi hi: Gentile te atu a sawltakpa khat ka hi laiteng in, keima nasepna sungah ka kiphasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka minampuite in eenna thin neisakin, pawlkhat beak amate ii sung pan ka suatak thei katawm maw ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate tuabangin a kinial ciangin leitung mihing dangte Pathian ngal dinmun panin, Pathian lawmte cina dinmun ah theng uh hi. Amate a kisaan ciangin bangbang hi tu ziam? A thite atu in nuntakna suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anluum a kileap masa sia Pathian atu in a kipia le a anluum buppi zongh ama aa ahi hi. Thingzungte Pathian atu in a kipia le a baakte zongh ama aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Inn olive baak pawlkhat kithiaktan a, ngam olive baak sia inn olive kung tungah kipee hi. No Gentile te sia tua ngam olive baakte taw na kibang uh hi, tu in Jew te ii a kho thaa nuntakna na nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom thingbaak bangin a kithiaktante sia na zawngsak bua het tu uh hi. Banghangin note kiphasak thei tu nu ziam? Note in a baak khat na hi bek uh hi. Note in a zung na vaak na taa bua uh hi — a zung in note hong vaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hi hi, ahihang kote om thei natu in a baakte kithiaktan hi ngawl ziam,” ci tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi hi, amate a kithiaktan sia banghang ziam cile amate in a up ngawl uh hang ahi hi. Note, tu a na dinmun uh ah na om theina in, na up uh hang ahi hi. Ahihang kiphasak heak vun; tua hi ngawlin kiitakna thin nei tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pianpui a baak ahi Jew te Pathian in dual tuan ngawl hi; no hong dual tu in na um uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hisia san ah Pathian in bangza in cingh a, bangza nasia takin thukhen thei ziam ci in ih mu thei hi. Ama in a puk sate tungah nasia takin thukhen hi — ahihang ama ii cikna le thiamna sungah na om uh le ama cingh hi. Tuabang na hi bua uh le, no zongh hong kithiaktan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang Jew te in a up thei ngawlna uh teng nusia hile, amate a om natu san ah kikoi kik tu hi; banghang ziam cile Pathian in amate koi kik thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />No Gentile te ahi ngam olive thingbaak sia kithiaktan a, ngeina om ngawlin, inn olive thingkung tungah hong kipee hi. Jew te sia inn olive thingkungte taw kibang hi, tua ahikom Pathian atu in, hi a kithiaktan a baakte amate kung tek tungah a pee kik tu ol zaw lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Suapuite awng, thumaan thutak ahi thuku khat a om sia na heak tu uh ka dei hi. Tua in noma le noma ciim na kisakna uh hong khaam tu hi. Hi thu ahi hi. Israel mite thinpuina sia a tawntungin a om tu hi ngawl hi. Ahihang Pathian kungah Gentile mite a theng tu in a kisee za a cin dong bek hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang hi thu in Israel mite theampo a kihut tu zia hi tu hi. Laithiangtho in: “Hunpa Zion panin hong pai tu a, Jacob suante tung panin ngitlona theampo heam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate ii mawna ka maisak ciangin, amate taw hi thuciamna ka vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jew te in Lungdamna Thupha a nial uh hu in no Gentile te phattuam natu in Pathian ngalte suak uh hi. Ahihang Pathian tealna hangin a pute a pate hu in amate in, Pathian ii lawmte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile tealin thupha a piakte tungtaang ah Pathian in a thin a kheal bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />No Gentile te na hi uh le a bosa hun sungah Pathian thu na ni bua uh hi; ahihang tu in Jew te thu nit ngawl hu in Pathian ii hesuakna na saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, note saansa hesuakna hu in amate zongh Pathian ii hesuakna a saan thei natu, tu in Jew te in Pathian thu a ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate theampo tungah a hesuakna a lak natu in Pathian in mihing theampo thunit nop ngawlna ii kol a bul luangtaate suaksak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian hauna bangza in lian ziam! a ciimna le a heakna bangza in thuk ziam! Ama ii thukhensat nate akua in sontel thei tu ziam? Ama zia akua in he ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Laithiangtho in: “Topa ii khua ngaisutna akua in he ziam? Akua in ama, ngaisutna pia thei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hong lo kik tu in akua in ama tungah bang pia ngei ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na theampo ama bitphua sa hi a, na theampo ama tungtawnin piang a, ama atu ahi hi. Pathian tungah minthanna a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom suapuite awng, Pathian ii a lian mama hong hesuakna hu in hi bangin note tungah kong ngen hi; noma le noma Pathian tungah a hingtang biakpiakna in kinei tavun a, ama ii dik a sak naseam tu in na ki aap tavun. Na piak tu uh biakna maan sia hisia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi leitung pianzia zil in na om heak vun a, na thinsung uh kikhealthiangna taw Pathian in na sungsang uh panin na puuathaksak sitset vun. Tua hile a pha, dik a sak kicing a sak Pathian ii deinate na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang Pathian ii thuthiamna letsong hong piak hu in, note theampo tungah hi bangin kong ci hi: Noma le noma a kilawm za sangin a saangzaw in na kingaisun heak vun. Tua hi ngawl zaw in, na khua ngaisutna sungah na hina bangin kingaisun tavun, tuaciangin mihing sim in Pathian piak upna za taw khat tek kisitna nei tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ih pumpi sungah na tam mama om hi, tuaciang hi nate in sepna tuatuam tek nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in eite mihing tam ih hi hangin Christ sungah kipawlin pumkhat ih hi hi. Khat le khat pumpi sung nate bangin ih kizom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ih saan letsong tuatuamte Pathian ii hong piak thuthiamna taw kizui in ih zangh tu hi. Ih letsong sia Pathian thupuakte son natu ahile upna ih neiza ciaciang taw ih son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepsak natu ahile zong ih sepsak tu hi. Hil natu ahile zong ih hil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngual hanthot natu ahile tuabang ma in ih seam tu hi. A neisa ngual a hawmte in ngo takin hawm tu hi. Thuneina neite in nasep hanciam tahen a, ngual tungah cikna le thiamna a zanghte in maitai takin zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ki itna in thin tak ahi tu thupi hi. A sia theampo ensan vun a, a pha ci theampo keamcing tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khat le khat Tapidaw unau khat bangin ki it in, khat le khat kizatak vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nasep hanciam vun a, datham heak vun. Thinsung bup kipiakna taw Topa atu seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lametna in hong lungdamsak tahen a, ngim ngana sungah thinsau tavun. Tuaciang a tawntungin thungen tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na neisa uhte na suapui a cimaw na Tapidaw puite hawm vun a, khualmite zindo tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hong vawtsiate thupha a saan natu in Pathian munah thungetsak vun — hi hi, Pathian in haamsiat ngawlin thupha a piak natu ngen vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lungdamte taw na lungdam khawm vun a, a kapte taw na kap khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kuama theampo atu a kibangin thinbotna na nei vun. Kiphasak heak vun a, nasep a niamte zongh seam thada heak vun. Noma le noma ciim kisa heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sia in hong vawt a om le a sia taw thuk heak vun. Mihing theampo ii pha hi ci in a ngaisutte sep tu hanciam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing theampo taw kilem a na nuntak thei natu in, noma sang panin na vawt thei theampo na vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lawmte awng, phu kilam heak vun. Pathian thin uukna ii a sep tu in koi zaw vun. Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Phu ka lam tu a, ka thuk kik tu hi, Topa in ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Laithiangtho ii ci bangma in phulam luangin, “Na ngalpa a ngil a kial le an na vaak in, a dang a ko le a dawn tu khat na pia in, banghang ziam cile hi bangin na sep hu in, a maizumna in meikaang bangin kaangh tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siatna in zosak heak vun; siatna sia phatna taw na zozaw vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing khat simin ngam uk thuneite thu na ni vun, banghang ziam cile Pathian oai ngawl po kuama in thuneina nei thei ngawl hi, tua thuneite sia amate sepna san tek ah Pathian ii a koi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A seam nginge lai thuneite a nalh sia in Pathian thupiak nalh suak hi; tuabangte in amate le amate tungah thukhenna a tungsak suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ngamukte sia mihing phate ii kiitak tu hi ngawl a, mihing ngilote ih kiitak tu hi bek hi. Thuneipa kiita ngawlin na om nuam ziam? Tua ahile na pha khat seam in, ama in hong pok tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />banghang ziam cile amate in Pathian naseam hi a, nangma phattuam natu in naseam hi. Ahihang ngitlona na vawt le lauthawng in, banghang ziam cile ama in daan piak theina vaang nei tatak hi. Amate sia Pathian naseam hi a, mihing ngilote tungah Pathian daan tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thu hu in thuneite thu na ni tavun — Pathian ii daan hong piak thei hang bek zongh hi ngawlin noma in khentel theina thin na nei uh hang zongh hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thu hu in shia na pia vun, banghang ziam cile, tua thuneite in a kicing takin a sep uh ciangin, amate in Pathian atu seam a suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate tungah na batte uh na lo vun, nangma pumpi tung pan ahizong na neisa tung pan ahizong shia cite peuma na pia vun, zatak tute na zakta vun a, upat tute na upat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ki itna khat simngawl kuama tungah leei na ba heak vun. Hi bangin a ngamta te Thukham zui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thupiak sungah, “Na kipalngul heak vun; mihing na that heak vun; na nguta heak vun; midangte neisa dungawk thin na nei heak vun,” hite theampo le a dangte sia, “Na innpaamte nangma na ki it bangin na it in,” ci thukham in huam siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ki itna in a innpaamte tungah, a ngamta khial ngei buatu hi; tua ahikom ki itna in Thukham buppi nitna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hisia na vawt uh kul hi, banghang ziam cile, na mutna uh panin, na khanlaw natu a hun cing zo hi, ci in na he uh hi. Ih upciil lai sangin tu in ih kingup natu naizaw zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zan hun bo dek zo a, sun hun hong theng dektak zo hi. Khuazing taw a kisai nate ih sepna panin tawp tawng; khuavak sungah kidona ngalvanhte zamh tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sun khuavak sungah a teangte bangin, eite a kilawmin ih ngamta tu hi — Lawplaina, zukhamna, a maizumhuai ngamtatna, kihauna tua ahibuale ki eennate ih vawt buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuate taangin Topa Jesus Christ ngalhiamte zamhin, cii le sa deina a lungkimsak thei lungngulnate na kheal tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note sungah upna zawngkhalte na saang vun. Ahihang amate ii aituam ngaisutnate tungtaang ah na kinial heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing khat in a upna hu in, neak thei theampo a ne hi, ahihang upna zawngkhal khat in nga le tee bek ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Neak thei theampo a nepa in, tuabangin a ne ngawl pa zawngsak heak hen; tuabang ma in nga le tee te bek a nepa in a sik theampo a nepa sit heak hen, banghang ziam cile Pathian in ama zongh saang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngualdang khat ii naseamte a sit tu in nang in bang thu nei ni ziam? Amate nasepna a zaw le a lel huvau a sit tu in a Topa om hi. Amate in zo tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in amate zosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing khat in ni tuam khat sia a dang nite sangin thupi zaw in ngaisun hi, tua laitakin mihing dang khat in ni theampo a kibangin ngaisun hi. Amate khat simin a thinsung uh khensat tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni tuam khat a thupi tuamin a ngaisun sia in Topa upatna taw ngaisun ahi hi; bang khat po a ne khat in Topa upatna taw ne ahi hi; banghang ziam cile ama in Pathian ii a piak an atu in lungdamko hi. Bang khat po neak tu a ten sia zongh in Topa upatna taw a ten hi a, ama zongh in Pathian tungah lungdamko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eite sungah khat zongh in ama nguak atu in a nungta ih om bua a — ama nguak atu in a thi zongh ih om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ih nungta le Topa atu a nungta ih hi a, ih thi le zong Topa atu a thi ih hi hi. Tua ahikom ih thi a ih nungta zong Topa ii neisa ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a thite le a nungtate ii Topa ahi natu in Christ thi a nuntakna sungah tho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahile note antee bek a nete in — na suapuite tungah banghangin thusit nu ziam — Banghangin no na theampo a nete in na suapuite zawngsak nu ziam? Eite theampo thusitna thuak tu in, Pathian mai ah ih ding tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “A nungta Pathian ka hi bangma in, mihing theampo ka mai ah khupdin tu a, tuaciangin mihing theampo in kei sia Pathian ka hina pualaak tu uh hi, Topa in ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom eite khat simin ih hi babang Pathian tungah ih pualaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom khat le khat, thu ih kikhen buatu hi. Tua hi ngawl zaw in na khensat tu uh sia in hisia ahi hi. Na suapuipa lutu natu ahizong, mawna sung a pu natu ahizong bangma vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Jesus taw ka kikopna panin ka heak thu khat in bang ziam cile an khat pawpo in ama nguakin a nin om ngawl hi; ahihang mihing khat in an khat nin hi ci in a um le ama atu in tua an sia nin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bang khat po na neak uh sia in na suapuipa thin nop ngawlna a piangsak le ki itna taw ngamtatna hi nawn ngawl hi. Na neakna uh taw Christ ii thina taw a tat sa mihing khat na lalsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pha hi ci in na ngaisutte uh na zangh khial heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian Ngam in neakna le dawnna thu hi ngawl a, Thaa Thiangtho ii piak thutang suana, thinnopna le lungdamna thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kua po ahizong hi bang a, Christ atu nasep a seamte in Pathian lungdamsak a, mihingte in lungkim pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom khat le khat atu in thinnopna le kithahatsak nate a piangsak nate na ngiim tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anneak huvau taw Pathian nasepna lalsak heak vun. An theampo neak thei ahihang, mihing khat po mawna sungah a puksak tu an ne heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na suapuipa a puk natu a piangsak thei sa ahizong, sapittui ahizong, ngamtatna khat pawpo ahizong, tang le uhte ngamtatna maanbel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hite huvau ah na upnate in nangma le Pathian kilaklaw thu ahikom na thinsung ah keam po tavun. Maan a sakte a sep ciangin a kithasung ngawl pa sia a lungdampa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang ama in a neak a dawnte tungah thinnop ngawlna a nei le, tuate a neak laitak mama in, Pathian in ama mawsak hi, banghang ziam cile ama ngamtatna in upna tungah a kibulphu bua hi. Upna a kibulphu ngawl na khat pawpo in mawna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upna sungah a thahat eite in, upna note vanh ngit dawnin ih hu natu ahi hi. Eima nop bek ih zong buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hi ngawlin eite khat simin ih suapuipa phattuam natu le upna sungah ih khantosak natu in, ama diksak tu in ih ngamta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ in ama ii nop a kizui bua hi. Tuabang hi ngawlin, laithiangtho ci bangin, “No hong selnote ii hong selnona sia kei tungah hong tu hi,” a ci bangin ngual atu in nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite thin sauna le hanthotna tungtawn a, upna ih nei natu in, Laithiangtho sungah a ki atte theampo in eite hong hil natu a ki at ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuak zawkna le hanthotna ii a naak ahi Pathian in, Jesus Christ zia na zuina uh taw note sungah tuabang khua ngaisutna hong piangsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note theampo in aw khat sa in, ih Topa Jesus Christ ii pa ahi Pathian na pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian minthan natu in Christ ii note hong saan bangma in, note zongh khat le khat na kisaang vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in thumaan a, amate ii pute pate tungah a kamciamte tungsak tu ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gentile te ngawngawn zongh in Pathian ii hesuakna a pok thei natu in Christ in Jew te naseampa suak hi kong ci hi. Laithiangtho in, “Tua ahikom Gentile te sung pan ka lungdamna nang tungah kong ko tu a, pokna la ka sa tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bangin ci thua hi, “Gentile te awng, Pathian ii mite taw lungdam vun!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ci kikna panin, “Topa pok vun, Gentile theampo awng; Pok vun, mihing theampo awng!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isaiah zongh in, “Jesse suan khat hong piang tu a; ama in Gentile te a uk tu in hong pai tu hi, tuaciangin amate in ama ii tungah, lametna nei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho thahatna taw, na lametna sungah na khanto natu in, lametna ii naak ahi Pathian in ama na upna uh hu in, lungdamna le thinnopna taw hong kidimsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suapuite awng, note phatna taw kidim tu in kong um a, heakna ci theampo zongh nei in, khat le khat kihil thei tawntung tu in kong um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang kong phawksak ngei thute tungtawnin hi laithak sungah ka hangsan mama hi. Tuabangin ka han ngawpna in banghang ziam cile Pathian in hunpha hong pia a, Gentile te atu a diang tu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus Christ ii naseampa hong suasak hang ahi hi. Thaa Thiangtho ii a aap Gentile te, Pathian ii saan thamman biakpiakna ahi thei natu in Pathian tung panin hong pai Lungdamna Thupha hil in thiampi khat bangin ka diang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus Christ taw pumkhat ka hina hangin Pathian nasep ka sepna huvau ah ka kisuangtaak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gentile te ii Pathian thu a nit natu lamhil tu in Christ in kei tungtawnin na hong sepna sa hang bekin hang takin ka pau ngam hi. Tua nasepna sia kammal le ngamtatna taw hong seam zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nalamdang lakna le a lamdang nate ii vaangletna le Pathian Thaa ii vaangletna taw hong seam zo hi. Tua ahiciang Jerusalem pan Illyricum ah khualhaw in ka paina ah Christ huvau Lungdamna Thupha a cingin ka thangsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tup ka sawm sia in, ngualdang khat po ii cian sa phungkawngte tungah inn a sa ka sua ngawl natu in Christ min a kiza ngeingawlna munte bek ah Lungdamna Thupha thansak tawntung tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Laithiangtho zongh in, “A thu a kihil ngeingawl mite in ama a mu tu hi, tuaciangin a za ngeingawlte in a tel tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi bangin note kungah kong pai tu tamvei ma hong kikhak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang tu in hi ngamkhente sungah ka nasepte ka man zo a, kum tam mama note taw kimu tu in hong pai nuam top ka hi hu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tu in hong pai thei tu in ka kilamen hi. Spain ngam ah ka pai lamin note taw ka kimu nuam a, tawmvei kong taam zawkciangin, tua munah ka pai natu hong hu le uhte ka uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahitazong, tu laitak Jerusalem ah a om Pathian mite atu seam tu in ka pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Macedonia le Achaia pawlpite in Jerusalem ah Pathian mi a cimawte huna tu sum pia tu in, amate thu in khensat zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hisia amate mama ii khensat ahi hi; ahihang a tatakin ci leang amate in tua mizawngte a hu tu sia a sep tu ahi hi. Jew te in thaa lam sangah thuphate Gentile te a hop bangma, Gentile te zongh in Jew te sia a leitung neisate taw a hu kik kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi nasep ka man zawkciang amate atu a kikhon sumte a bup in, amate tungah ka aap zawkciang Spain ngam ah ka pai tu a, ka pai lam in kong baang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kong pai ciangin Christ thupha a kicing taw kong pai tu sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Suapuite awng, ih Topa Jesus Christ hang le, Thaa ii hong piak itna hu in, Pathian tungah kei atu in nasia takin thu nong nget pui natu in kong thuum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judea ngam thu um ngawlte khut sung pan hong kep natu le Jerusalem ah ka nasepna in Pathian ii mihingte atu a kisaang thei ahi natu in thu hong ngetsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua hi a, lungdam in note kungah kong pai tu a, Pathian ii deina ahile, thathak laakna in note kungah kong haw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ih thinnopna ii naak ahi, Pathian in note theampo taw hong om tahen. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cenchreae pawlpi ah a seam ih suapuinu Phoebe sia note tungah ka pokna kam kong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ii mihingte ngamtat tu bangin Topa min taw ama na saang vun a, tuaciangin huna zongh note tung panin a kisap babang na pia vun; banghang ziam cile ama in mihing tam ma ii lawm pha hi a, kei atu zong lawm pha khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus Christ sungah ka naseppui Priscilla le Aquila tungah paupuina kam ka thaak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in kei atu in a nuntakna aitaa ngam hi; amate tungah ka lungdam hi — kei nguak bek zongh hi ngawlin, Gentile pawlpi mite theampo zongh a lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate inn ah a kikhawm pawlpi tung zongh ah paupuina kam ka thaak hi. Asia ngamkhen pan Christ a um phitbelpa, ka it ka lawm Epaenetus tung zongh ah paupuina kam ka thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note atu in nasia takin na a seam Mary ka paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka Jew mipui, kei taw thongtaak khawm Andronicus le Junia tungah paupuina kam ka thaak hi; amate sia sawltakte in pha takin a heak uh hi a, kei sangin Tapidaw a suak masazawte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa kipawlna sungah ih seppui Ampliatus ka it ka lawm zongh ka paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Christ nasepna sungah ih seppui Urbanus le Stachys ka it ka lawmte zongh ka paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Apelles ka paupui hi, ama ii Christ tungah a thumaanna sia sit natu om ngawl hi. Aristobulus innkuanpuite tungah paupuina kam ka thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka Jew mipui Herodion le Narcissus innkuanpuite sung Tapidaw suapuite ka paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa nasepna sungah a seam Tryphaena le Tryphosa luangin, Topa nasepna sungah nasia takin a seam ka it ka lawm Persis ka paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa nasepna sungah a kician tuamin a seam Rufus le a tapa bang tatak a hong vawt, a nu tungah paupuina kam ka thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka paupuina kam Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermes, Patrobas le Hermas le a dang amate taw a om Christ mite ka thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philologus le Julia, Nereus le a suapuinu le Olympas le amate taw a om Pathian mite theampo ka paupui siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khat le khat unau ki itna taw kipaupui in na kinamh vun. Christ pawlpite theampo in no hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Suapuite awng: pawl khenna piangsak a, mihingte upna a lumlette, tuaciang na saansa kihilnate a langpante encik tavun a, amate kung pan na kikeam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile tuabangin a ngamtate in ih Topa Christ atu in a seamte hi ngawl a, amate ngilpi atu in a seamte ahi uh hi. Amate in kamneal le kisialpoknate taw bangma a he ngawl mihing pawlkhat a theam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungdamna thu tungah na thumaan uh sia a kuama po in hong he a, tua hu in note huvau in ka lungdam hi. A pha nate ah na ciim tavun a, a sia tungtaang ah na paubaang heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang ih thinnopna ii naak ahi Pathian in Satan sia hai ngawlin na peang nuai ah siiktham tu hi. Ih Topa Jesus thuthiamna in note taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka naseppui Timothy in hong paupui hi; tuasia bangma Lucius, Jason le Sosipater, ka Jew minampuite zongh in hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi lai a atpa keima, Tertius in Tapidaw kipaupuina lai kong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A inn sia pawlpi kikhopna in a kizangh ka zintunna pa Gaius zongh in hong paupui hi; khuapi sumkeampa Erastus le ih suapui Quartus in hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna note theampo taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eite in Pathian tungah minthanna pia tawng. Jesus Christ huvau Lungdamna Thupha ka hilna bang le a bosa hun sau mama sungah a kiseal thumaan thutak hong kilak bangin Ama in na upna uh sungah kip takin na din thei natu in vawt thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu in ahile kamsaangte lai atna sung panin tua thumaan thutak sia a kilanghtakna ah kikoi zo hi; tuaciangin a nungta tawntung Pathian sawlna taw minam theampo in um a, a nit thei natu in amate tungah kihesak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ciimna namcin a nei, khatbek ahi Pathian tungah Jesus Christ tungtawnin minthanna kip tawntung tahen! Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
